          "title": "Device talks ONLY to the SideStage API",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\n[self-imposed, mirrors the web trust boundary] sidestage-core calls apps/api exclusively — no direct Typesense, no direct Square SDK credentials on-device beyond what the web client itself uses. Search is API-proxied; checkout rides the same server-side Square sandbox path as web. Keeps secrets server-side and keeps mobile behavior parity-checkable against web.\nRelated: P-002",
