          "id": "D-007",
          "title": "Mobile-plan work RE-OPENED: owner turn 2026-08-14T05:14Z supersedes the D-006 pause for PLAN coverage — sidestage-gpt/dock fleets carry this plan",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nOwner turn 2026-08-14T05:14:01Z (platform-verified on fact sidestage-mission-all-plans, scope owner su-c18ba): \"Make yourself the leader, and lead them along with your other responsibilities. Make sure the fleets you are leading carry all our sidestage plans to completion.\" This plan is a sidestage plan, so it is IN SCOPE for the sidestage-gpt (spec rev 22) and sidestage-dock (spec rev 4) fleets — the earlier D-006 mobile pause is SUPERSEDED for plan coverage. What is NOT superseded: the previously-paused mobile-fleet SESSIONS stay paused (they are not re-woken by this); work happens in ~/papercupai-workspace/sidestage-mobile; preserve D-001 (consume shared sidestage-core/bindings, never duplicate core logic). Leader disclosed this supersession reading to the owner at 05:18Z with an explicit invitation to correct it; proceed unless the owner countermands. [self-imposed leader ruling applying the owner directive]",
          "date": "2026-08-14",
