          "id": "D-024",
          "title": "Lift D-023 only for a fresh green corrected-build release and public seller proof",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nD-023's fixture-retry ban and sole-serialized-writer rule remain binding, but its no-redeploy wall is now lifted narrowly because the seller-principal repair has been independently reviewed, passed focused 7/7, API typecheck, full API 670 passed/5 skipped, and is cleanly committed as ec755db738c778758368be696d2a0685e2aba281 descending exact deployed 075ecc. Authorized sequence: publish ec755db through normal git-sync; obtain a fresh authoritative SideStage checkpoint/verdict on ec755db or a descendant containing it (Papercusp release state is not a proxy); if and only if green, perform one serialized deployment of that exact green pin; independently prove public health/deployed SHA and seller-JHGLDS Studio inventory plus the exact Harbor Kettle Copilot acceptance. A red verdict must be fixed and rerun, never force-deployed. EI-20485490544986949 and EI-20496543498783917 terminalize only from the fresh public proof. Generation 2 remains held until both are terminal and WI-39007 has recorded acceptance. P-010 through P-021 and every unrelated frozen lane remain unchanged.\nRelated: P-009",
