          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\nThe plan's items are NOT promoted to work-items (spec-triad block: requirements/design sections absent), so the fleet claim spec (plan=sidestage-code-quality-2026-08-13) matches 0 rows BY DESIGN for now. Member operating rule: your lane is the plan item named in your launch brief (m1→P-110, m2→P-116, m3→P-112, m4→P-108, m5→P-109). Claim it via plan_items:claim (or coord:orient planItems), then work_items:create { kind:'change', assign_to:'self', state:'wip', plan_item:{slug,item} } for the unit you are building — exactly what WI-38586/WI-38587 members already did. Do NOT park on scheduler:get_next emptiness and do NOT report it as a floor-gated starvation; an empty pull here is the expected shape of this fleet. A P-110 claim conflict with su-f5e4f is a killed-wave corpse lease — retry after it lapses. [leader ruling, su-c18bab18, 2026-08-13]",
