      "markdown": "---\ntitle: Prepare evidence-grounded answers to 45 SideStage interview questions\nslug: sidestage-interview-answer-pack-2026-08-19\nstatus: draft\ncreated: 2026-08-19\nupdated: 2026-08-19\n---\n\n# Prepare evidence-grounded answers to 45 SideStage interview questions\n\n## Now\n\n**State:** Draft. Plan body to be filled in.\n\n**Next:** human reviews scope and lists Phase 1 items.\n\n## Background\n\n(Why this plan exists; what problem it addresses.)\n\n## Phase 1 — TODO\n\n(Use plans:add-item to populate. Each item is one line:\nsingle id, status token, free text, optional blocked-by.)\n\n\n## Phase — Evidence\n\n- **P-001** `done` Recover the two supplied artifact contents where accessible, locate the canonical SideStage repositories and docs, and build a source map for every factual claim. importance: high — note: ← WI-39927 completed (done)\n- **P-002** `done` Draft concise spoken answers to all 45 questions, explicitly distinguishing verified implementation facts from suggested personal/product framing. blocked-by: P-001 importance: high — note: ← WI-39928 completed (done)\n- **P-003** `done` Cross-check architecture, thresholds, action rules, realtime/video paths, deployment, test coverage, and live-coding file locations against current code and tests. blocked-by: P-002 importance: high — note: ← WI-39929 completed (done)\n- **P-004** `todo` Polish the pack for interview delivery: lead with direct answers, add caveats where personal attribution requires Avi's correction, and present it in a scannable rehearsal format. blocked-by: P-003 importance: high\n\n\n\n\n## Decisions\n\n(Use plans:add-decision to append. Each decision is a third-level\nheading with a date line and a body paragraph.)\n",
