          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-14 ~13:35Z, interactive turn to su-c18ba, verbatim: \"I approve teh mobile design,  make sure the fleet implements that now\"]. The sidestage-mockup-approved gate is FIRED (latched). All three flagged layout calls are RATIFIED as made: (1) chat opens as a bottom sheet from the room bar (not a third tab); (2) Hold stays INLINE on the product row; (3) the stage is INLINE with gutters (stats visible without scrolling). The mockup is the SPEC, not a reference — deviations come back to the owner. The eight platform deltas D1–D8 in the mockup's reference table are settled and citable by key. Mockup: https://claude.ai/code/artifact/0115eb0e-8fc1-4730-8009-0cc1398735b1 · canonical source ~/.papercusp/hives/sidestage/mockups/mobile-buyer-orders.html. Owner directive: implementation starts NOW — leader to route the plan items into the fleet pool.",
