          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-13] Sub-2s product-research fallback = Tavily/Exa (key ships in submission access-notes). LLM lineup all on the existing OpenAI key: triage = gpt-4o-mini streaming (<300ms budget); grounded replies = gpt-4o-mini streaming (TTFT <1s, complete <2s, retrieval parallel); judge = stronger gpt-5.x-class model, offline in Test tab. TTFT + complete latency stamped per reply; p50/p95 on seller HUD.\nRelated: P-013, P-015, P-023",
