          "title": "Shared lib repos FLIP PUBLIC (with secrets/history audit each); extraction policy ratified; HOLD LIFTED — cleared to execute",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-13] (a) The consumed lib repos (papergrid, sync, sse, ui-primitives, agent-chat, token-kit, + newly extracted) flip PUBLIC so reviewers can recursively clone — each gets a secrets/history-hygiene audit BEFORE flipping. (b) Extraction policy per the tier model ratified. (c) OWNER CLEARED EXECUTION: 'Cleared — execute after these answers' — the D-002 hold is lifted: create the sidestage pot (public GitHub sidestage repo under the papercusp account), then launch the headless GPT-5.6-Luna-max fleet on this plan. Service topology ratified in discussion: web (Vite SPA) + api (single NestJS service) + postgres + typesense + zero-cache + mediamtx in one docker-compose.",
