          "title": "Zero/ZQL migration chain is out of scope for this release drive",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-16\nThe auction plan's P-010..P-021 (Zero contract package, zero-cache provisioning, WS-first sync provider, domain cutovers, parallel-path retirement) awaits Avi's architecture review and is NOT a public-release prerequisite. Fleet members do not touch it. [owner-context: Avi's directive is webapp public-release readiness; the Zero chain's own plan Now names Avi as reviewer.]",
