          "completionSummary": "P-024 COMPLETE — prod deploy of pin 5f4c1b5b3276a721256660ce4e613cf14d1b7e36 (authorized by sidestage-auction-chat-public-release-2026-08-14#D-027, protocol per this plan's D-004) executed and succeeded, plus post-deploy zero-console re-verify per D-003.\n\nDEPLOY: preflight (lock free, dry-run OK 1097 files, tree HEAD==pin exactly, only trivial non-app watchdog-state diffs) → `bash deploy/deploy.sh` → rsync 1097 files, idempotent schema apply (no errors), api+web images built+tagged sidestage-api:5f4c1b5b3276..., containers recreated+started, health check PASSED on public leg (DNS/TLS/Traefik confirmed) reporting sha=5f4c1b5, release positive control PASSED (6 real in-stock rows, Scout returned 6 products), release event hygiene PASSED (no probe residue), deployed sha recorded on prod. Final script line: \"Done. Public: https://sidestage.buyrestart.com (verified serving 5f4c1b5 via public leg).\"\n\nPOST-DEPLOY VERIFY: verdict headless-browser (CLI screenshot/console/network capture tool) swept buyer homepage, live event watch page (Chat tab, 8s through a heartbeat interval), Seller info tab, /studio. `verdict console` = \"No console messages\" at every step. `verdict network` full log = every request 200/201/204/304, zero 4xx/5xx — including repeated POST /api/chat/events/sunday-drop/presence (the heartbeat endpoint) returning 201 each time, direct evidence EI-20589266065184157 (heartbeat-404 loop) is fixed in prod. Screenshot artifact captured: /tmp/wi39463-evidence/buyer-homepage.png (verdict screenshot of the live post-deploy homepage, console clean at capture time).\n\nD-027 is now SPENT. Reporting to leader su-6613215b for the full-green re-grade.",
