          "id": "D-019",
          "title": "P-013 deploy rides WI-38661's in-flight working-tree redeploy — remaining P-013 work is LIVE-VERIFICATION only",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nThe sidestage deploy.sh rsyncs the WORKING TREE content of git-tracked files (3b39b's WI-38661 checkpoint, verified), so the redeploy currently running (pid 3075338, gated on npm test + typecheck green) already carries the dockview code: P-011 chrome fix, P-012's QA-hardened state, and the committed seller-dock surface. Therefore P-013 does NOT need a second deploy. Remaining P-013 work: after work-item:done:WI-38661 fires, live-verify the dockview surfaces on prod (seller tab loads, drag/resize/close-reopen/reset function, chrome theme correct) and close P-013 with that evidence. Sequencing guard unchanged: e1a3a's WI-38710 lock regen lands only AFTER WI-38661 closes (no install churn under a build), and P-013 live-verify should run against the post-WI-38661 bundle. Acceptance rubric for this plan: authored AFTER P-013 + P-015 + WI-38710 land (post-implementation rule), graded by a non-implementer — a2076 and e1a3a are implementers and thus excluded from grading.",
