          "title": "WI-38710 landing RE-GATED: the D-017 override set is falsified by the full-clone pre-check — landing requires a REVISED override set with a green pre-check",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nOBSERVATION (e1a3a, 05:39Z, full-clone pre-check per the D-017 landing protocol): applying the ruled npm overrides + full lock regen REMOVES @linaria/react from the tree, taking apps/web from 2 red vitest files to 10. The override set as ruled is therefore NOT landable. The underlying diagnosis is unchanged (glide-data-grid@^6 peer range caps react at 18.x, materializing a nested react@18.3.1 — D-017 seq 54). GATE: WI-38710 lands only when BOTH hold: (1) a revised override set passes the same full-clone pre-check with the 2 known reds going green and ZERO new reds (the @linaria/react edge preserved or correctly re-supplied — the edge that supplies it today is an open question, investigate before revising); (2) WI-38661 (prod redeploy) is closed, so the lock-regen install cannot churn node_modules under a deploy build (leader ruling 05:36Z). Priority note: P-015 outranks WI-38710 for e1a3a; the duplicate-React defect blocks neither gate nor deploy (D-016/D-017).",
