            "addedTests": true,
            "testResult": "tsc exit 0, no diagnostics. Vitest: 5 files, 43/43 passed. Baseline before my edits on the pre-existing chat+db suites was 53 passed / 1 skipped, so nothing regressed. The verbose run confirmed BOTH real-Postgres integration legs ACTUALLY EXECUTED against 127.0.0.1:55434 rather than skipping: 'PgChatStore against Postgres > survives a store restart, deduplicates retries, and hides moderated messages' (81ms) and the NEW 'PgChatStore against Postgres > expires stale presence without a read, and leaves live participants in place' (54ms); 12/12 in that file. STILL RED AT TIP AND NOT MINE: schema-guard.test.ts 'lists exactly the tables schema.sql creates' plus data-surface-census.test.ts x2, all failing on targeted_offer / targeted-offer.store.ts from Lane B (aa261, WI-39614) in-flight — my diff adds no table and no process-local Map, and aa261 was notified and offered help.",
